<div id="left_column_flip" class="left_column_flip">

  <p>This site runs on <a href="https://alaveteli.org">Alaveteli</a>, free
    software for making and publishing Freedom of Information requests. It is
    used by sites in many countries where anyone can make a request.</p>

  <p>Here accounts and request correspondence stay private. Only reviewed documents are published.</p>

  <p>Published documents have a catalogue and feed: see the <a href="<%= help_api_path %>">notes for programmers</a>.</p>

  <p>See also the <a href="<%= help_credits_path %>">credits</a>.</p>

